WEBVTT

00:06.000 --> 00:07.210
No...

00:08.000 --> 00:09.420
Not him, either.

00:10.130 --> 00:11.540
Aww, man...

00:12.500 --> 00:14.710
Which formula is this?

00:15.920 --> 00:19.210
I was sure this is where the last boss would be.

00:19.420 --> 00:24.210
So is this one of those events that focuses on
group battles and there actually is no boss?

00:25.250 --> 00:28.000
Guess I'll check underground, just in case.

00:31.080 --> 00:34.670
If there's nothing there,
I'll pick up the rest of the gold coins and head home.

00:43.750 --> 00:45.830
That is too late

00:45.830 --> 00:48.750
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

00:48.750 --> 00:50.880
That is to say...

00:53.830 --> 01:00.040
The first move chooses an unknown future
Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future<b></b>

01:00.040 --> 01:02.380
How it will be
Sono arisama<b></b>

01:02.750 --> 01:03.880
This way

01:03.880 --> 01:10.130
The last move decides the world's answer
Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer<b></b>

01:10.130 --> 01:12.750
A single winner
Hitori no winner<b></b>

01:12.750 --> 01:14.130
It's me

01:14.380 --> 01:16.670
These eyes have seen it
Kono me wa misueta<b></b>

01:18.170 --> 01:23.750
The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o<b></b>

01:25.040 --> 01:28.830
It's all a game to control the board
Subete wa banjou shihai suru game<b></b>

01:28.830 --> 01:31.330
A battle of thought
Shikou no tousou<b></b>

01:31.500 --> 01:33.880
I disguise even my mistakes
Mistake sae mo gisou shite<b></b>

01:33.880 --> 01:36.460
And even checkmate is a preparatory move
Checkmate made fuseki toshite<b></b>

01:36.460 --> 01:38.880
A game to take each other's king
King o ubaiau game<b></b>

01:38.880 --> 01:41.330
Ideology and desire
Shisou to yokubou<b></b>

01:41.630 --> 01:44.000
A bad move to not let one chance get away
One chance minogasanu akushu<b></b>

01:44.000 --> 01:46.710
The last chance will cinch it
Last chance kanarazu shitomeru<b></b>

01:46.960 --> 01:48.960
That is too late

01:48.960 --> 01:51.880
You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai<b></b>

01:51.880 --> 01:54.040
That is to say

01:54.040 --> 01:59.000
Total victory is in my hands
Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni<b></b>

02:04.290 --> 02:07.080
No one can catch up now
Dare nimo mou oitsukenai<b></b>

02:08.080 --> 02:13.000
<b>#03 The Hour of Awakening</b>

02:12.290 --> 02:13.500
Where's Cid?!

02:13.500 --> 02:15.170
Cid! Where are you?!
Queen Elisabeth!<b></b>

02:15.170 --> 02:16.170
Cid!

02:16.170 --> 02:17.580
Who the hell are you?

02:18.130 --> 02:18.710
I don't sense Crimson's presence anymore.

02:18.710 --> 02:20.210
I don't sense Crimson's presence anymore.
Does this mean Cid wasn't the sacrifice?<b></b>

02:20.210 --> 02:21.000
And the coffin is gone.
Does this mean Cid wasn't the sacrifice?<b></b>

02:21.000 --> 02:21.210
And the coffin is gone.
Seriously, that boy does nothing but worry me!<b></b>

02:21.210 --> 02:23.330
What in the world happened here?
Seriously, that boy does nothing but worry me!<b></b>

02:23.920 --> 02:25.330
Claire! Look out!
Oh, man, I need to get back to town right now!<b></b>

02:25.330 --> 02:26.380
Oh, man, I need to get back to town right now!

02:31.630 --> 02:34.080
Cid...

02:36.750 --> 02:37.960
Claire...

02:52.420 --> 02:53.750
Oh no...

02:54.830 --> 02:56.380
Queen Elisabeth!

03:00.880 --> 03:02.380
I was too late!

03:03.380 --> 03:04.580
Claire!

03:07.920 --> 03:10.170
No, please don't, Queen Elisabeth!

03:25.670 --> 03:26.880
Target secured!

03:37.040 --> 03:39.170
Queen Elisabeth...

03:42.170 --> 03:43.380
It's you...

03:43.750 --> 03:44.750
How is she?

03:44.750 --> 03:45.960
She's still breathing.

03:45.960 --> 03:48.630
But I'm not sure emergency first aid will be enough.

03:48.880 --> 03:50.130
I see.

03:50.460 --> 03:53.580
But it doesn't look like we'll be
able to beat a hasty retreat.

03:54.210 --> 03:56.920
Our lord and master has not yet revealed himself.

03:56.920 --> 04:01.000
That means he has some higher priority,
some grand purpose to achieve first.

04:01.750 --> 04:05.380
In other words, he has trusted me
to handle this situation.

04:05.380 --> 04:09.420
My lord's sister is dying.
I cannot allow her life to be lost.

04:09.420 --> 04:11.210
I must finish this quickly.

04:11.580 --> 04:13.580
664, you continue to care for her.

04:13.580 --> 04:16.130
665, 666, cover me!

04:16.130 --> 04:16.960
Right!

04:16.960 --> 04:17.960
You got it!

04:28.880 --> 04:29.880
She used her flesh to-

04:29.880 --> 04:31.630
I can't move!

04:38.170 --> 04:39.420
This is for you!

04:46.210 --> 04:47.420
It's no use.

04:47.920 --> 04:50.210
I admit, you people are strong.

04:50.830 --> 04:52.290
But my Lady...

04:53.540 --> 04:55.460
My queen has always...

04:55.920 --> 04:58.080
been a slow riser due to low blood pressure!

05:00.880 --> 05:02.290
This magical energy...

05:02.540 --> 05:03.960
It's greater than Lady Alpha's?

05:04.380 --> 05:05.670
My, my...

05:05.670 --> 05:07.830
You look like such a darling little thing.

05:08.130 --> 05:10.670
But you are quite the monster, aren't you?

05:11.080 --> 05:14.170
I shall have to time my departure carefully.

05:19.080 --> 05:23.250
Hey, quit having so much fun without inviting me!

05:24.580 --> 05:25.830
That's...

05:25.830 --> 05:27.960
Juggernaut of the Black Tower.

05:29.420 --> 05:30.790
You little...

05:36.040 --> 05:37.670
That bitch...

05:38.290 --> 05:40.290
What do you think you are doing?

05:40.580 --> 05:41.790
Shut up!

05:50.080 --> 05:51.750
Keep Miss Claire safe!

06:00.040 --> 06:01.830
Damn it all to hell!

06:10.500 --> 06:11.710
Dammit...

06:11.710 --> 06:14.790
You went out of your way to take the full brunt of it?
Are you that stupid?

06:14.790 --> 06:16.290
Can it, she-fox!

06:16.290 --> 06:17.290
Oww!

06:17.290 --> 06:20.040
Aw, crap, it's broken.

06:20.380 --> 06:22.250
Well, he will be useless now.

06:22.750 --> 06:24.250
What about them?

06:27.210 --> 06:28.630
Queen Elisabeth...

06:29.040 --> 06:30.250
She's not yet...

06:32.210 --> 06:33.460
You're hurt...

06:33.460 --> 06:34.830
I'm fine.

06:38.670 --> 06:39.880
She's all right.

06:41.710 --> 06:45.170
She's expended all that magical energy,
yet shows no signs of fatigue.

06:46.250 --> 06:48.000
Quite the contrary.

06:48.000 --> 06:51.290
She's taking our blood, and healing herself.

06:51.750 --> 06:52.960
No...

06:54.080 --> 06:56.210
She's making herself even more powerful.

06:56.500 --> 06:59.790
Number 666, take Miss Claire and get out of here.

06:59.790 --> 07:01.710
No, I can still...

07:01.710 --> 07:04.830
You still have things you need to do, don't you?

07:05.880 --> 07:07.710
Right now, you must keep yourself alive.

07:17.960 --> 07:19.170
Impossible...

07:24.330 --> 07:25.920
Our possessed blood...

07:26.540 --> 07:28.920
She's controlling the blood of the Demon?!

07:31.420 --> 07:34.630
How dare she spit in the face of
Lord Shadow's blessing?

07:38.210 --> 07:39.460
Miss Claire!

07:39.580 --> 07:40.790
Miss Claire!

07:41.130 --> 07:42.330
Miss Claire!

07:45.040 --> 07:50.960
<b>Claire</b>

07:55.460 --> 07:56.750
Oh, you're awake?

07:59.290 --> 08:00.630
Possession...

08:00.630 --> 08:03.630
Those symptoms that have been
causing you so much anxiety...

08:03.630 --> 08:05.580
You were fully cured long ago.

08:06.080 --> 08:08.460
After all, he knows everything.

08:08.960 --> 08:10.250
Fully cured?

08:10.630 --> 08:13.500
My possession is gone?

08:13.830 --> 08:15.130
Who is "he"?

08:15.130 --> 08:17.130
Someone you know very well.

08:17.130 --> 08:18.540
But I don't know!

08:18.790 --> 08:21.080
What are you talking about?
What's going on?

08:21.380 --> 08:26.250
To put it simply, you are adapting,
and unfortunately, you have lost control.

08:26.420 --> 08:29.170
Very soon, your body will turn into a rotting mess.

08:29.880 --> 08:32.580
So, I'm going to give you just a little bit of help-

08:32.580 --> 08:34.000
Make some sense!

08:34.540 --> 08:37.040
I have absolutely no idea what is happening!

08:37.040 --> 08:39.130
Where am I?
Who are you?

08:39.130 --> 08:41.330
And who in the world is this "he" person?!

08:42.170 --> 08:43.960
That's an awful lot of questions.

08:44.460 --> 08:48.000
Is this a negative side effect of
relaxed education policies, I wonder?

08:49.710 --> 08:51.460
This is going to get a bit long.

09:01.290 --> 09:03.670
Have you heard of "evolution"?

09:03.670 --> 09:08.330
It's a theory proposed by one scientist
suggesting that people used to be monkeys.

09:08.330 --> 09:13.460
After many long years, those monkeys adapted to
their environment and became humans.

09:13.710 --> 09:15.330
What are you talking about?

09:15.330 --> 09:17.460
What does this have to do with my current situation?

09:17.460 --> 09:23.960
But then another scientist came along and said that
living creatures do not adapt to their environment.

09:24.630 --> 09:29.210
In their harsh natural environment,
only the smartest monkeys survived,

09:29.210 --> 09:30.710
and eventually became humans.

09:30.710 --> 09:32.790
I said, what are you talking about?

09:32.790 --> 09:37.000
In other words, the monkeys didn't adapt intentionally.

09:37.290 --> 09:40.670
The ones that happened to already be
adapted to the environment survived,

09:40.670 --> 09:42.460
and changed physically.

09:42.460 --> 09:43.670
And then...

09:45.040 --> 09:46.380
What were we talking about?

09:46.380 --> 09:47.880
I have no idea.

09:47.880 --> 09:48.920
Oh, right!

09:48.920 --> 09:50.830
We were talking about adapting.

09:50.830 --> 09:52.130
The point is,

09:52.130 --> 09:54.330
the fact that the blood has divided
into two different types

09:54.330 --> 09:56.170
is another result of adaptation.

09:56.790 --> 09:59.080
Possessed and Progenitor Vampires...

09:59.080 --> 10:03.630
The bloodline split in two, and the characteristics
of each are clearly differentiated.

10:05.500 --> 10:10.630
And now, those two types of blood
are trying to adapt inside of you.

10:12.710 --> 10:15.500
Unfortunately, you have the right constitution,

10:15.500 --> 10:20.210
and even more unfortunately,
you don't know how to control it.

10:20.670 --> 10:24.210
And that's why the blood has gone
berserk, and your body is...

10:25.000 --> 10:27.290
Oh, it's just about time.

10:28.290 --> 10:29.290
Wait!

10:29.290 --> 10:31.130
You were about to say something really important!

10:35.380 --> 10:36.580
What?

10:36.580 --> 10:39.880
That will teach you how to control your powers.

10:39.880 --> 10:41.540
Can you explain it a little more-

10:41.540 --> 10:42.750
There's no time.

10:42.750 --> 10:45.210
Things are really getting out of hand outside.

10:45.880 --> 10:46.880
Come back!

10:46.880 --> 10:48.750
Who are you?
And what is your deal?

10:49.080 --> 10:51.170
Why are you helping...

10:51.880 --> 10:53.710
Are you helping me?

10:53.710 --> 10:55.420
I am Aurora.

10:55.420 --> 10:58.790
And I helped you because you are his.

10:58.790 --> 11:00.420
But who is "he"?!

11:01.580 --> 11:02.790
Shadow.

11:03.130 --> 11:04.330
Shadow?

11:12.250 --> 11:14.080
No... How...

11:15.580 --> 11:17.670
Claire, is that you?

11:23.130 --> 11:25.460
My first taste of freedom in about a month.

11:25.460 --> 11:27.130
The Witch of Calamity...

11:28.580 --> 11:30.130
What are you doing here?

11:30.130 --> 11:31.420
What happened to Claire?

11:31.830 --> 11:33.040
Claire?

11:33.040 --> 11:34.790
Oh, you mean how I look?

11:34.790 --> 11:37.250
It's the same as what he does, and you.

11:37.420 --> 11:39.880
It's just easier to move with my usual physique.

11:39.880 --> 11:43.500
Oh, and the change of color isn't magic,
it's the reflection of the light...

11:45.080 --> 11:46.670
It's a little tight here.

11:47.880 --> 11:49.080
That's better.

11:49.830 --> 11:51.040
Now then...

11:51.750 --> 11:54.420
How much of this can you handle?

11:57.080 --> 11:58.290
Sorry...

11:58.670 --> 12:00.500
but I'm the original.

12:04.250 --> 12:05.460
How...

12:05.460 --> 12:10.330
Stealing control of blood that has
left its body isn't hard to do.

12:10.580 --> 12:12.290
As you can see.

12:17.880 --> 12:19.210
Oh, you're lively!

12:19.210 --> 12:21.580
That's how you young people should be!

12:27.290 --> 12:29.790
Oh, come on.
Like anything goes?

12:29.790 --> 12:31.960
It is rather over the top.

12:35.330 --> 12:40.210
As a bonus, I'll show you the most
almighty power in the world!

12:42.750 --> 12:43.960
What is this?

12:48.500 --> 12:49.920
No, you wouldn't!

12:50.580 --> 12:52.040
I...

12:52.880 --> 12:54.710
am the...

12:55.000 --> 12:56.420
all...

13:03.080 --> 13:04.290
Oh, dear...

13:04.290 --> 13:06.250
It looks like this body couldn't handle it.

13:06.250 --> 13:07.630
Excuse me!

13:07.830 --> 13:10.170
A little thing like this will heal in no time.

13:10.170 --> 13:11.750
You can do it too, can't you?

13:11.750 --> 13:12.960
I can what?

13:16.080 --> 13:17.080
Not again!

13:17.080 --> 13:18.290
It's fine.

13:18.290 --> 13:19.710
This is enough.

13:20.750 --> 13:23.000
My work here is done.

13:23.000 --> 13:26.380
I was only buying time until he arrived.

13:26.710 --> 13:27.920
"He"?

13:40.080 --> 13:41.750
Him again...

13:42.380 --> 13:44.380
Enter the star of the show.

13:44.380 --> 13:45.710
I see, I see...

13:49.040 --> 13:51.210
The hour of awakening has arrived.

13:53.380 --> 13:54.790
The hour...

13:55.540 --> 13:56.960
of awakening...

13:58.000 --> 13:59.210
has arrived!

14:15.080 --> 14:16.670
Such immense magical energy...

14:16.670 --> 14:18.710
He's holding his own against Queen Elisabeth?!

14:19.080 --> 14:20.290
Shadow...

14:20.540 --> 14:22.830
It's true, you are more powerful
than the Witch of Calamity.

14:23.380 --> 14:24.580
That's strange...

14:25.290 --> 14:28.500
Why is he taking time to entertain himself
with an exchange of blows?

14:29.210 --> 14:32.580
He is already within easy striking range.

14:32.960 --> 14:35.000
Lord Shadow could take her out in a single-

14:37.000 --> 14:38.210
Nami!

14:40.880 --> 14:42.080
No...

14:42.670 --> 14:44.330
I don't believe it, Lord Shadow...

14:45.540 --> 14:47.500
Are you shielding us from her onslaught?

14:48.290 --> 14:50.170
Knowing that we're helpless against her?

14:51.210 --> 14:53.000
It doesn't matter the weight of the load.

14:53.710 --> 14:56.080
I can't afford to lose a single one.

14:58.250 --> 14:59.540
Lord Shadow!

14:59.540 --> 15:03.880
I see the noble benevolence of your heart,
shining like glittering gold!

15:05.960 --> 15:08.420
I cannot afford to lose a single one.

15:08.670 --> 15:12.170
Lord Shadow, is that how deeply you care for me?

15:12.960 --> 15:15.460
Then Beta has nothing more to say.

15:15.710 --> 15:17.170
No more...

15:17.540 --> 15:21.130
I pray for your victory!
You can do it, Lord Shadow!

15:21.750 --> 15:23.290
I can't afford...

15:23.960 --> 15:25.540
You can do it!

15:25.540 --> 15:27.540
...to lose...

15:27.960 --> 15:31.710
I believe in you, Lord Shadow!

15:31.710 --> 15:33.330
...any more!

16:00.580 --> 16:02.170
That's the great Shadow!

16:02.170 --> 16:03.920
What a fearsome sight!

16:04.540 --> 16:07.330
What does he think he's doing, flying in the sky?

16:07.330 --> 16:08.540
Indeed.

16:08.920 --> 16:11.080
He is quite the surprising individual.

16:28.880 --> 16:32.330
Tonight's game has gone on long enough,
Your Majesty.

16:33.380 --> 16:37.750
Would you be so kind as to tell me
your name, my good sir?

16:41.630 --> 16:42.830
I...

16:43.210 --> 16:44.420
am...

16:44.420 --> 16:46.710
No! Please, wait!

16:47.210 --> 16:51.460
Queen Elisabeth!

16:53.420 --> 16:55.250
Recovery Atomic.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.460
Quinton!

17:16.960 --> 17:18.710
She'll be all right now.

17:22.960 --> 17:25.420
I, on the other hand, am nowhere near all right.

17:26.960 --> 17:29.210
Eta is going to have a field day with this.

17:31.460 --> 17:32.960
The Haven...

17:33.830 --> 17:36.290
A place where you can be with the ones you love.

17:37.500 --> 17:39.710
We're leaving, 666.

17:46.000 --> 17:50.000
That punk's gang, what'd he call it?
Shadow Garden?

17:50.330 --> 17:53.790
I'm thinking it could be fun to
go pick a fight with them.

17:55.500 --> 17:57.880
Our rise to adulthood...

17:57.880 --> 18:00.960
We should consider ourselves lucky just to be alive.

18:01.210 --> 18:02.830
My sword, my armor...

18:02.830 --> 18:04.330
I lost everything...

18:04.330 --> 18:06.750
Consider yourself lucky that you made it out alive.

18:17.170 --> 18:19.460
<i>Ghouls, vampires, the possessed...</i>

18:19.460 --> 18:23.580
<i>They all have different names, but in the end,
they're all just magic overload.</i>

18:24.380 --> 18:25.880
<i>Curing it is easy.</i>

18:26.290 --> 18:30.580
<i>But there are afflictions out there that can't be cured.</i>

18:32.630 --> 18:34.670
My left arm is tingling.

18:35.080 --> 18:38.540
It's true, I have special powers.

18:39.000 --> 18:43.960
Is my blood destiny trying to lead me somewhere?

18:48.960 --> 18:52.210
<i>Bandages, magic circles, special powers...</i>

18:52.540 --> 18:53.580
<i>You guessed it.</i>

18:53.580 --> 18:55.670
<i>My sister has got it bad.</i>

18:56.790 --> 19:00.040
<i>But I can't dismiss her pain, because I, too-</i>

19:00.040 --> 19:03.790
<i>No, all children have walked this path at some point.</i>

19:04.750 --> 19:08.920
<i>And brushing off a child's concerns
is what drives them to delinquency.</i>

19:09.330 --> 19:10.540
Cid...

19:12.630 --> 19:14.000
I should tell you...

19:14.710 --> 19:16.330
The thing is...

19:16.960 --> 19:21.960
there are special powers that have
taken root in my left hand.

19:23.210 --> 19:24.420
And I...

19:24.790 --> 19:28.000
I have to solve the mystery of these powers.

19:28.250 --> 19:29.750
If I know you, Sis, you'll be fine.

19:31.330 --> 19:35.670
No matter what path you follow,
I'll be behind you all the way.

19:41.830 --> 19:44.130
Thank you, Cid.

19:57.670 --> 20:02.080
Cid, do you know about him?
Shadow?

20:03.710 --> 20:05.920
The guy who burned down our school?

20:05.920 --> 20:07.330
What about him?

20:10.830 --> 20:12.040
Nothing, never mind.

20:13.420 --> 20:17.880
<i>I'm sure my sister has all kinds of
trials and tribulations ahead of her.</i>

20:19.380 --> 20:23.380
<i>She'll have to confront her anxiety, her pain, reality.</i>

20:24.000 --> 20:27.330
<i>But her left hand has started tingling,
so there's nothing we can do about it.</i>

20:28.290 --> 20:31.790
<i>Because that's how children grow into adults.</i>

20:34.000 --> 20:37.460
<i>We've been through a lot, but this event is now over.</i>

20:38.040 --> 20:40.420
<i>I struggled with a few unforeseen setbacks,</i>

20:40.420 --> 20:43.580
<i>but let's just say, "All's well that ends well."</i>

20:45.750 --> 20:49.380
<i>Alas, I never managed to recover all the gold coins.</i>

20:49.960 --> 20:52.000
<i>I was supposed to have three thousand,
but the next thing I knew,</i>

20:52.000 --> 20:54.040
<i>there were only five hundred left.</i>

20:54.250 --> 20:56.790
<i>With the current exchange rate,
that's only 50 million zeni.</i>

20:56.790 --> 20:58.960
<i>Not nearly enough to support me my whole life.</i>

20:59.790 --> 21:03.380
<i>But if you think about it, maybe this is plenty.</i>

21:03.960 --> 21:09.130
<i>After all, the Lawless City will always be here,
and there are still two towers standing.</i>

21:09.670 --> 21:12.540
<i>If I'm ever in financial straits, I can just come back.</i>

21:13.880 --> 21:15.460
<i>Because the Lawless City...</i>

21:16.580 --> 21:18.540
<i>is my piggy bank.</i>

21:40.460 --> 21:44.330
An endlessly deep dark night
Doko made mo fukai yamiyo to<b></b>

21:44.330 --> 21:47.170
I thought, as I closed my eyes
Omotte me o tsubutteta<b></b>

21:47.170 --> 21:52.330
Still unaware of the voice of the star calling out to me
Yobikakeru hoshi no koe ni kizukenai mama<b></b>

21:52.750 --> 21:56.710
A faint light, not too bright
Mabushiku wa nai awai hi<b></b>

21:56.710 --> 21:59.460
But comforting, that's how you were
Kokochi ii sonna anata o<b></b>

21:59.460 --> 22:03.330
Before I knew it, I was following you with my eyes
Shiranu uchi ni me de oikaketa<b></b>

22:03.330 --> 22:05.920
Even if I run out of breath
Iki o kirashite<b></b>

22:06.330 --> 22:09.380
And start to stumble
Motsuresou ni natte mo<b></b>

22:09.380 --> 22:11.630
I've never felt this before
Kono kimochi wa hajimete<b></b>

22:11.630 --> 22:15.540
I can't stop the feeling
Mita koto no nai jibun ni aeru<b></b>

22:15.920 --> 22:19.380
That I can meet a me I've never seen before
Yokan ga tomaranai<b></b>

22:19.880 --> 22:22.790
I run down the path in front of me
Me no mae no michi o hashiru<b></b>

22:22.790 --> 22:25.880
I run far, even when I'm lost
Tooku, mayotte mo<b></b>

22:25.880 --> 22:29.710
If I look up, you won't have changed
Miagereba anata wa kawaranaide<b></b>

22:29.710 --> 22:32.040
You'll be there
Soko ni iru koto o<b></b>

22:32.040 --> 22:35.040
It may be strange, but I can believe it
Fushigi demo shinjirareru<b></b>

22:35.040 --> 22:38.080
Kaze ga tsuyoi hi mo
Even on windy days<b></b>

22:38.080 --> 22:42.580
I don't have to try to reach over you
Over you todokeyou to shinakutatte ii<b></b>

22:42.580 --> 22:44.920
Hey (Did you know?)
Nee (Shitteru?)<b></b>

22:44.920 --> 22:47.960
As all the stars revolve
Subete no hoshi ga mawarinagara<b></b>

22:47.960 --> 22:51.210
I keep my sights on you
Anata o mezashiteru<b></b>

22:51.210 --> 22:54.170
Polaris in the Night

23:27.960 --> 23:29.170
Now...

23:30.830 --> 23:32.460
Let's hear what you have to say.
